// # js/ — Home enhancement, not a router
//
// Logline: Copy, headline rotate, panel arrows. Home body is HTML.
//
// Setup: index.html loads these after the static panels. No-JS sees
//        the same install box and constellation via <noscript>.
//
// Beats:
//   1. copy.js — clipboard + execCommand fallback.
//   2. rotate.js — hero typewriter; honors reduced motion.
//   3. panels.js — scroll-port arrows. Not a hash router.
